➤ table_name[12,0,0]  ¦  mode[12,0,0]  ¦  coverage[12,0,0]  ¦  columns_analyzed[-5,0,0]  ¦  population_rows[-5,0,0]  ¦  population_exact[-6,0,0]  ¦  sample_rows[-5,0,0]  ¦  sample_blocks[-5,0,0]  ¦  sample_bytes[-5,0,0]  ¦  status[12,0,0]  ¦  message[12,0,0]  𝄀
